                "card_sub": "Tuesday – Saturday · 10:00 – 18:00",
                "eyebrow": "Our story · since 2014",
                "heading": "A workshop for instruments\nthat [em]don't fit[/em] a category.",
                "lead": "Tapadum started as a duo of Italian musicians chasing a single Turkish oud across three Istanbul workshops. Eleven years later, our atelier in Brisighella is the home address for 26 master luthiers across the Mediterranean — and the shipping desk for nearly 2,500 hand-tuned instruments delivered worldwide.",
